---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { COMPANY } from '../../consts/company';
---

<Layout title="南康到广东家具运输专线 — 专业家具物流 — 新大物流" description="新大物流提供南康至广州、佛山、中山、顺德家具运输专线，南康家具产业集散地直提直送，当天发货次日到达；提货送货到楼下，入户按送装计费，破损按保险理赔。本专线不直接提供包装，可推荐合作包装企业完成家具、设备打包。">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative pt-20 md:pt-24 pb-12 md:pb-16 bg-brand-900 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-700/40 to-brand-900"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-16 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-white/80 text-xs md:text-sm mb-6 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/10">
        南康↔广东家具专线
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">南康到广东家具运输专线</h1>
      <p class="text-white/70 text-sm md:text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto">产地直提直送 · 当天发车次日达 · 提货送货到楼下 · 破损按保险理赔</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 服务概述 -->
  <section class="py-14 md:py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-16 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-surface-800 mb-6">南康家具发广东，选新大物流</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-surface-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
            <p>南康作为中国重要的家具产业集散地，每年有大量家具运往广东各地。新大物流深耕赣粤专线近二十年，专门开设南康↔广东家具运输专线，为南康家具企业提供安全、专业、高效的物流服务。</p>
            <p>我们深知家具运输的特殊性——体积大、价值高、易磕碰。为此我们规范作业：轻拿轻放、分类码放、车厢铺垫保护毯，全程在途跟踪、到货及时通知派送，每一个环节都有专人负责，尽量减少运输磕碰。请注意，本专线不直接提供包装业务，可推荐合作包装企业完成家具、设备打包，也建议您在发货前将家具妥善包装。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center p-8 md:p-12">
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-20 h-20 md:w-24 md:h-24 rounded-2xl bg-white/80 backdrop-blur flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-sm">
              <svg class="w-10 h-10 md:w-12 md:h-12 text-brand-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M5 8h14M5 8a2 2 0 110-4h14a2 2 0 110 4M5 8v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V8m-9 4h4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-2xl font-bold text-surface-800">南康家具运输专线</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-surface-500 mt-2">专业团队护航 · 直达广东各地</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 包装标准 -->
  <section class="py-14 md:py-20 bg-surface-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-surface-800 mb-4">运输与提送标准</h2>
        <p class="text-surface-500 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">从装车到提送规范作业，减少运输磕碰（专业包装请发货前自行完成）</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-surface-100">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <span class="text-brand-600 font-bold text-xl">1</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">产地直提直送</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-500">南康家具产业集散地上门提货，直达广东各网点，减少中转搬运损耗</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-surface-100">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <span class="text-brand-600 font-bold text-xl">2</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">稳固码放</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-500">轻拿轻放、分类码放，重不压轻、大不压小，避免货物相互挤压</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-surface-100">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <span class="text-brand-600 font-bold text-xl">3</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">保护毯铺垫</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-500">车厢内铺垫专用保护毯，缓冲途中震动与冲击，尽量减少磕碰损伤</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-surface-100">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <span class="text-brand-600 font-bold text-xl">4</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">在途跟踪</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-500">全程信息反馈，途中运行与到货情况及时通报，让您随时掌握货物动态</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-surface-100">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <span class="text-brand-600 font-bold text-xl">5</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">拆装与提送</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-500">送货前简单拆装不收费；货车可送至楼下，如需入户搬抬安装，按送装服务另行计费（视路程与货量）</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-surface-100">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <span class="text-brand-600 font-bold text-xl">6</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">全程保险</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-500">中国太平洋保险承保，货物破损按保险额度理赔，让您发货更安心</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 服务优势 -->
  <section class="py-14 md:py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-surface-800 mb-4">选择我们的理由</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">产地直提</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-500">南康家具产业集散地直提直送，减少中转搬运损耗</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">快速直达</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-500">当天发货，直达广东各网点，中转环节少，时效有保障</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">保险齐全</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-500">中国太平洋保险承保，破损按价理赔，发货有保障</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800 mb-2">提货送货到楼下</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-500">可预约指定时间配送，货车送至楼下；入户搬抬按送装服务另计</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 服务区域 -->
  <section class="py-14 md:py-20 bg-surface-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-surface-800 mb-4">服务区域</h2>
        <p class="text-surface-500 text-sm md:text-base">南康家具直达广东各大城市</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-6">
        {[
          { city: '广州', desc: '广州全市范围配送' },
          { city: '佛山', desc: '佛山全市范围配送' },
          { city: '中山', desc: '中山全市范围配送' },
          { city: '顺德', desc: '顺德全区范围配送' },
        ].map((area) => (
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 text-center border border-surface-100 shadow-sm">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 font-bold text-lg">
              {area.city.charAt(0)}
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-800">{area.city}</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-surface-500 mt-1">{area.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-14 md:py-20 bg-brand-600">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">南康家具要发广东？</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-sm md:text-lg mb-8">立即致电，为您提供专业的家具运输解决方案</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href={`tel:${COMPANY.hotline}`} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 md:px-10 md:py-4 bg-white text-brand-600 font-bold text-base md:text-lg rounded-xl hover:bg-surface-50 transition-all shadow-lg">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"/></svg>
          {COMPANY.hotline}
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 md:px-10 md:py-4 bg-white/10 text-white font-semibold text-base md:text-lg rounded-xl border border-white/30 hover:bg-white/20 transition-all">
          在线询价
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 结构化数据：BreadcrumbList + FAQPage -->
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify([{
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "首页", "item": "https://www.xinda56.cn" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "服务范围", "item": "https://www.xinda56.cn/services" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "家具运输", "item": "https://www.xinda56.cn/services/furniture" }
    ]
  }, {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "南康家具发到广州物流要多久？",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "新大物流南康到广州家具专线当天发货、次日到达。从南康家具产业集散地直提直送，直达广州各网点。"
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "家具运输怎么包装才安全？",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "本专线不直接提供包装业务，可推荐合作包装企业完成家具、设备打包；也可在发货前用珍珠棉、护角等将家具妥善包装。装车时我们会轻拿轻放、分类码放并在车厢铺垫保护毯，尽量减少运输磕碰。"
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "家具到了广东能送货入户吗？",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "货车可送至收货地址楼下；如需搬入室内并安装，属送装服务，按送货路程和货量另行计费（例如白云区范围内通常100元/次，量多另计），可提前预约。"
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "家具在运输中损坏了怎么办？",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "新大物流所有货物由中国太平洋保险承保，运输中出现破损可按保险额度按价理赔。建议发货时购买足额保险，到货先验货再签收。"
        }
      }
    ]
  }, {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Service",
    "name": "南康到广东家具运输专线",
    "provider": {
      "@type": "LocalBusiness",
      "name": "赣州开发区新大货运部",
      "telephone": "15717088088"
    },
    "serviceType": "家具物流运输",
    "areaServed": ["南康", "广州", "佛山", "中山", "顺德"],
    "description": "南康家具产业集散地直提直送，当天发货次日到达；送货前简单拆装不收费，提货送货到楼下，入户按送装另计，太平洋保险承保，破损按保险理赔。本专线不直接提供包装，可推荐合作包装企业完成家具、设备打包。"
  }])}>
  </script>
</Layout>
